<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"{{if .ConfiguredURL}} data-url="{{.URL}}"{{end}}>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<meta name="description" content="{{.Name}}: a karaoke song feed. Subscribe with kfeed or a game that supports karaoke feeds.">
<title>{{.Name}} · Karaoke song feed</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:,">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="index.css">
<script src="index.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Karaoke song feed</p>
    <h1>{{.Name}}</h1>
    {{if .Description}}<p class="lead">{{.Description}}</p>{{end}}
    <p class="meta">Run by {{.Operator}}{{if .Signed}} · <span class="badge ok">Signed</span>{{else}} · <span class="badge">Unsigned</span>{{end}}</p>
    <dl class="facts">
      <div><dt>Songs</dt><dd>{{num .Songs}}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Categories</dt><dd>{{len .Catalogs}}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Size</dt><dd>{{.Size}}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Updated</dt><dd>{{.Updated}}</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">
  <section>
    <h2>Get these songs</h2>
    <p>You reached a karaoke song feed: a collection of songs in the UltraStar format that karaoke games such as
      UltraStar Deluxe, Vocaluxe or Performous can play. Subscribe once, and your copy stays up to date.</p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><strong>Get kfeed</strong>, a small program for Windows, macOS and Linux:
        <a href="{{.Repo}}/releases">download it from the releases page</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Subscribe</strong> into a new folder inside your game's songs folder, for example:
{{- if .Private}}
        <div class="code"><code id="cmd-sync">kfeed sync - ~/.ultrastardx/songs/{{.Slug}} --all</code><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="cmd-sync" hidden>Copy</button></div>
        <code>kfeed</code> then asks for the feed address. Paste your personal address:
        <div class="code"><code id="cmd-address"><span class="feed-url">{{.URL}}</span>{{if .Key}}#ed25519={{.Key}}{{end}}</code><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="cmd-address" hidden>Copy</button></div>
{{- else}}
        <div class="code"><code id="cmd-sync">kfeed sync <span class="feed-url">{{.URL}}</span>{{if .Key}}#ed25519={{.Key}}{{end}} ~/.ultrastardx/songs/{{.Slug}} --all</code><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="cmd-sync" hidden>Copy</button></div>
{{- end}}
        On Windows, use your game's songs folder instead, e.g. <code>C:\Games\UltraStar\songs\{{.Slug}}</code>.
        To choose single categories, replace <code>--all</code> with <code>--catalog</code> and an id from the list below.</li>
      <li><strong>Start the game.</strong> To update later, run <code>kfeed sync</code> with just the folder.</li>
    </ol>
{{- if .Private}}
    <p class="note"><strong>This address is yours alone.</strong> It gives access to this feed in your name:
      don't pass it on and don't post it. If it got out, ask the operator for a new one.</p>
{{- end}}
    <p>Games with built-in support for karaoke feeds only need the feed address:</p>
    <div class="code"><code id="feed-address"><span class="feed-url">{{.URL}}</span>{{if .Key}}#ed25519={{.Key}}{{end}}</code><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy="feed-address" hidden>Copy</button></div>
    <noscript><p class="note">The feed address is the address of this page, with <code>feed.json</code> at the end.</p></noscript>
    <p><a href="{{.Repo}}/blob/main/docs/player-guide.md">Player guide: all options, updates, offline copies</a></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Categories</h2>
    <div class="cards{{if .Inline}} wide{{end}}">
    {{range .Catalogs}}
      <article class="card">
        <h3>{{.Name}}</h3>
        <p class="meta">id <code>{{.ID}}</code> · {{num .Songs}} songs · {{.Size}}</p>
        {{if $.Inline}}<details open>
          <summary>Songs</summary>
          <ul class="songs">
          {{range .List}}<li><span class="artist">{{.Artist}}</span> – {{.Title}}<span class="lic">{{.License}}</span></li>
          {{end}}</ul>
        </details>{{else}}<p><a class="button" href="{{.Page}}">Browse the {{num .Songs}} songs</a></p>{{end}}
      </article>
    {{end}}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Licenses</h2>
    <p>Every file in this feed carries its license. Songs are counted here by the license of their audio.</p>
    <table class="licenses">
      <thead><tr><th>License</th><th>Songs</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {{range .Licenses}}<tr><td>{{if .URL}}<a href="{{.URL}}">{{.ID}}</a>{{else}}{{.ID}}{{end}}</td><td>{{num .Count}}</td></tr>
      {{end}}</tbody>
    </table>
    {{if .Undeclared}}<p class="note">{{num .Undeclared}} songs have no declared license (NOLICENSE). Clients hide them unless you ask for them.</p>{{end}}
    <p class="note">NC = NonCommercial, ND = NoDerivatives, SA = ShareAlike. <code>kfeed sync --exclude nc</code> leaves out NonCommercial songs.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>About this feed</h2>
    <dl class="about">
      <dt>Operator</dt><dd>{{.Operator}}</dd>
      <dt>Contact and takedown requests</dt><dd><a href="{{.Contact}}">{{.ContactText}}</a></dd>
      {{if .Homepage}}<dt>Homepage</dt><dd><a href="{{.Homepage}}">{{.Homepage}}</a></dd>{{end}}
      <dt>Signature</dt><dd>{{if .Signed}}Signed with Ed25519. Key{{if gt (len .Keys) 1}}s{{end}}: {{range .Keys}}<code class="key">{{.}}</code> {{end}}{{else}}Not signed: only use the original address, not copies.{{end}}</dd>
      {{if .Mirrors}}<dt>Mirrors</dt><dd>{{range .Mirrors}}<code>{{.}}</code> {{end}}</dd>{{end}}
      <dt>Format</dt><dd><code>{{.Spec}}</code>, version {{.Sequence}}</dd>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Run your own feed</h2>
    <p>Any community can publish songs like this: put song folders into a folder, run <code>kfeed build</code>,
      and serve the result with any web server. No server code, no database.</p>
    <ul class="links">
      <li><a href="{{.Repo}}/blob/main/docs/operator-guide.md">Operator guide</a>: adding, updating and removing songs</li>
      <li><a href="{{.Repo}}/blob/main/docs/hosting.md">Hosting guide</a>: web server, CDN, security</li>
      <li><a href="{{.Repo}}/blob/main/docs/signing.md">Signing guide</a>: keys and their care</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p>Generated by kfeed {{.Version}} · <a href="{{.Repo}}">karaoke-feeds on GitHub</a>: format specification, tools and guides (MIT license).</p>
    <p>This page loads nothing from other websites and sets no cookies.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
